WEBVTT

00:00:08.110 --> 00:00:14.300
Mobile Suit Zeta Gundam

00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:22.680
aoku nemuru mizu no hoshi ni sotto

00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:22.680
Kissing softly the star of water that sleeps in blue,

00:00:22.680 --> 00:00:31.410
kuchizuke shite inochi no hi wo tomosu hito yo

00:00:22.680 --> 00:00:31.410
A person who lights the fire of life,

00:00:31.410 --> 00:00:36.300
toki to iu kin'iro no sazanami wa

00:00:31.410 --> 00:00:36.300
The time, the golden ripple,

00:00:36.320 --> 00:00:45.070
oozora no kuchibiru ni umareta toiki ne

00:00:36.320 --> 00:00:45.070
is a sigh from the lips of the sky,

00:00:45.070 --> 00:00:49.300
kokoro ni uzumoreta

00:00:45.070 --> 00:00:49.300
The stars of kindness...

00:00:49.300 --> 00:00:52.270
yasashisa no hoshitachi ga

00:00:49.300 --> 00:00:52.270
...buried in heart flame up...

00:00:52.270 --> 00:00:56.440
honoo age yobiau

00:00:52.270 --> 00:00:56.440
...and call to each other,

00:00:56.440 --> 00:01:03.430
namima sasurau nanpasen no you ni

00:00:56.440 --> 00:01:03.430
Like wrecked ships wandering on the waves...

00:01:03.430 --> 00:01:08.870
mou nakanaide ima

00:01:03.430 --> 00:01:08.870
Don't cry, any more,

00:01:08.870 --> 00:01:16.240
anata wo sagashite iru hito ga iru kara

00:01:08.870 --> 00:01:16.240
because now there is a person looking for you,

00:01:16.240 --> 00:01:20.970
omae ni aitai yo to

00:01:16.240 --> 00:01:20.970
Dying to see you...

00:01:35.760 --> 00:01:40.330
While cooperating with Karaba's attack,
the Hyaku Shiki and Zeta Gundam...

00:01:40.540 --> 00:01:45.170
...ended up descending from
orbit to Kilimanjaro.

00:01:45.710 --> 00:01:50.240
There, Kamille met Four Murasame.

00:01:50.770 --> 00:01:55.630
Forever Four

00:02:20.240 --> 00:02:21.870
What are you hesitating for?

00:02:22.580 --> 00:02:25.070
We're better off waiting for
the Audhumla to return.

00:02:25.980 --> 00:02:29.080
That way, we'll be able to
prepare sufficiently.

00:02:29.690 --> 00:02:32.350
But it would also give the enemy
that much extra time.

00:02:32.420 --> 00:02:33.390
That's true.

00:02:33.990 --> 00:02:37.820
The assault force at the mountain's foot
is waiting for orders to attack.

00:02:37.890 --> 00:02:40.260
You've been entrusted
with the right of command.

00:02:40.830 --> 00:02:44.360
We won't beat them by force alone.

00:02:45.270 --> 00:02:46.530
Lieutenant Quattro.

00:02:46.600 --> 00:02:49.260
I wish you wouldn't underestimate
Karaba's abilities.

00:02:50.540 --> 00:02:52.470
Let me think about it for a while.

00:02:56.750 --> 00:02:57.840
What's the matter?

00:02:57.910 --> 00:02:59.400
Why aren't we going out?

00:02:59.480 --> 00:03:03.080
I'm worried that you won't fight
to the best of your abilities.

00:03:03.220 --> 00:03:05.980
Are you thinking that
we should've killed Four?

00:03:06.820 --> 00:03:08.850
It's not that simple.

00:03:08.920 --> 00:03:14.020
If we had killed Four, you probably
would have become useless as a pilot.

00:03:14.100 --> 00:03:16.430
Four is a Cyber-Newtype.

00:03:16.500 --> 00:03:22.460
But she possesses the power to
influence those people close to her.

00:03:23.470 --> 00:03:27.880
Are you suggesting that I'll be
totally spellbound by that power?

00:03:27.940 --> 00:03:32.570
You probably think that
you can convince Four to change.

00:03:33.250 --> 00:03:39.120
If you also believe that and cooperate
with me, we can defeat the Psyco Gundam.

00:03:39.190 --> 00:03:41.050
And Four will become normal.

00:03:41.120 --> 00:03:42.060
No.

00:03:42.120 --> 00:03:46.580
Four's conscious mind has been
manipulated and altered artificially...

00:03:46.660 --> 00:03:48.650
...with the use of drugs and hypnotism.

00:03:49.830 --> 00:03:51.990
You're guessing without any proof.

00:04:07.050 --> 00:04:11.710
I'm told the fleet receiving you won't be
entering satellite orbit before dawn.

00:04:11.790 --> 00:04:12.980
Thank you.

00:04:13.560 --> 00:04:16.150
- I'm going to go take a nap.
- Yes, sir!

00:04:26.140 --> 00:04:28.470
A new model mobile suit.

00:04:55.360 --> 00:04:56.850
So she <i>is</i> here.

00:05:01.470 --> 00:05:04.200
Kamille. Kamille.

00:05:07.740 --> 00:05:09.440
Freeze, intruder!

00:05:10.280 --> 00:05:12.870
I'll shoot if you move!

00:05:13.220 --> 00:05:14.180
Bang!

00:05:19.820 --> 00:05:20.790
Four.

00:05:21.360 --> 00:05:22.320
Kamille.

00:05:22.760 --> 00:05:24.560
Four, I was dying to see you.

00:05:25.390 --> 00:05:26.620
Kamille!

00:05:31.700 --> 00:05:33.430
Lieutenant Jerid! You mustn't!

00:05:33.500 --> 00:05:35.440
You're still a patient here!

00:05:35.500 --> 00:05:39.410
If I had gone out, I could've shot down
at least one enemy!

00:05:39.610 --> 00:05:41.410
Why didn't you inform me sooner?!

00:05:41.780 --> 00:05:44.440
You've come here from space
to receive treatment!

00:05:45.450 --> 00:05:46.440
Move!

00:05:49.080 --> 00:05:52.750
I'll be right back!
I'm just going to check the battle situation!

00:06:02.030 --> 00:06:03.930
I was sure you'd come back to see me.

00:06:04.630 --> 00:06:06.330
Am I not a bother?

00:06:06.400 --> 00:06:07.630
Not at all!

00:06:07.700 --> 00:06:09.470
Why even ask such a question?

00:06:09.540 --> 00:06:10.530
Well, just because.

00:06:10.610 --> 00:06:12.770
Would you prefer a cola or guava juice?

00:06:13.240 --> 00:06:14.830
You decide.

00:06:14.910 --> 00:06:15.740
<i>That's strange.</i>

00:06:15.810 --> 00:06:17.370
<i>There's no surveillance camera.</i>

00:06:17.450 --> 00:06:20.280
<i>And Four's attitude is totally different</i>
<i>from during the day.</i>

00:06:23.390 --> 00:06:25.440
<i>She's like a different person.</i>

00:06:25.950 --> 00:06:28.450
<i>Yet I still feel she's the same Four.</i>

00:06:29.790 --> 00:06:30.760
Four!

00:06:30.990 --> 00:06:32.960
Did you find out what your real name is?

00:06:34.900 --> 00:06:38.300
<i>If you want your memory back,</i>
<i>you must defeat the A.E.U.G., Four.</i>

00:06:38.730 --> 00:06:40.170
<i>Hate them, Four.</i>

00:06:40.240 --> 00:06:42.200
<i>Hate the A.E.U.G.!</i>

00:06:42.370 --> 00:06:43.430
Four!

00:06:46.040 --> 00:06:47.270
It's my favorite!

00:06:47.340 --> 00:06:49.500
Thank you!

00:06:51.580 --> 00:06:52.550
Kamille.

00:06:55.150 --> 00:06:56.450
But it's odd.

00:06:56.520 --> 00:07:01.150
I had forgotten all about you
until I was taking a bath.

00:07:02.160 --> 00:07:03.780
I wonder why.

00:07:03.860 --> 00:07:06.020
You no longer care for me, do you?

00:07:09.500 --> 00:07:11.160
I'll always love you.

00:07:11.700 --> 00:07:15.190
But I become a different person
when I pilot the Psyco Gundam.

00:07:16.440 --> 00:07:18.200
<i>Mr. Amuro was saying</i>
<i>something about that.</i>

00:07:18.270 --> 00:07:21.140
<i>That Four only fights</i>
<i>because of the combat system.</i>

00:07:22.410 --> 00:07:24.680
The inside of my head becomes blank...

00:07:25.380 --> 00:07:27.180
...and a different "me" takes over.

00:07:27.950 --> 00:07:29.420
That's why...!

00:07:29.490 --> 00:07:30.750
You mustn't get in it!

00:07:30.820 --> 00:07:33.480
You don't have to
pilot that machine again, Four!

00:07:34.590 --> 00:07:38.120
If you say not to,
then I won't do it.

00:07:38.330 --> 00:07:39.290
Four.

00:07:57.880 --> 00:07:58.850
Four!

00:07:59.850 --> 00:08:02.780
My head. My head hurts.

00:08:02.850 --> 00:08:05.010
M-Medicine...!

00:08:05.090 --> 00:08:06.180
Where?!

00:08:06.260 --> 00:08:07.720
Th-There...!

00:08:10.290 --> 00:08:11.880
This?

00:08:18.000 --> 00:08:20.030
This won't do. It's not enough!

00:08:21.600 --> 00:08:24.230
I'll get some more!
Where do I need to go?!

00:08:24.340 --> 00:08:25.400
No.

00:08:25.470 --> 00:08:27.530
You won't be able to get it, Kamille.

00:08:27.610 --> 00:08:29.100
I must go myself.

00:08:29.580 --> 00:08:30.910
Then we'll go together!

00:08:31.280 --> 00:08:32.750
Show me the way.

00:08:33.280 --> 00:08:34.250
Kamille.

00:08:34.520 --> 00:08:36.710
You're not my enemy, are you?

00:08:36.790 --> 00:08:39.280
Of course not! Now, let's go!

00:08:46.460 --> 00:08:49.260
- I need medication! Four's...!
- Four?!

00:08:49.330 --> 00:08:50.920
She says she has a headache!

00:08:53.140 --> 00:08:54.730
Get me the "Afta-millenan"
compound solution!

00:08:54.800 --> 00:08:55.770
Right!

00:08:56.670 --> 00:08:58.640
What kind of medicine is that?

00:08:59.510 --> 00:09:01.310
Why, you're Kamille Bidan!

00:09:04.010 --> 00:09:05.500
He's the A.E.U.G.'s Newtype!

00:09:05.580 --> 00:09:06.780
He's a Gundam pilot!

00:09:07.450 --> 00:09:08.780
Don't do it!

00:09:11.920 --> 00:09:13.410
You! Don't move!

00:09:14.990 --> 00:09:16.580
- That keyboard!
- Don't move!

00:09:18.760 --> 00:09:20.280
"Four Murasame."

00:09:20.660 --> 00:09:23.890
"The fourth Cyber-Newtype created
by Murasame Laboratory?"

00:09:23.970 --> 00:09:25.230
She's not a Cyber-Newtype!

00:09:25.300 --> 00:09:27.600
We're trying to artificially create
real Newtypes...!

00:09:27.670 --> 00:09:29.030
What did you say?!

00:09:29.100 --> 00:09:31.100
We must find ways to
strengthen humans...

00:09:31.170 --> 00:09:33.110
...if we're going to compete
against Newtypes.

00:09:33.180 --> 00:09:35.140
Is that something humans should do?!

00:09:35.410 --> 00:09:37.540
To manipulate people's minds
like you have done?!

00:09:37.980 --> 00:09:40.180
Give her memory back to her! Now!

00:09:40.950 --> 00:09:42.310
That's impossible!

00:09:43.020 --> 00:09:47.350
Memories of a human being cannot be
so conveniently erased and then returned!

00:09:47.990 --> 00:09:48.890
What?!

00:09:48.960 --> 00:09:50.790
Stop it, right there!

00:09:50.860 --> 00:09:53.790
You can take that woman as a hostage,
but that won't stop me!

00:09:54.660 --> 00:09:55.890
Lieutenant Jerid.

00:09:55.960 --> 00:09:58.130
Die, Kamille!

00:09:58.630 --> 00:09:59.600
Four!

00:10:00.270 --> 00:10:02.960
If you bully Kamille, I won't forgive you!

00:10:03.510 --> 00:10:04.470
Bitch!

00:10:05.010 --> 00:10:06.630
You stupid Cyber-Newtype wannabe!

00:10:07.080 --> 00:10:09.540
Four! Don't go! Four!

00:10:10.180 --> 00:10:12.980
Don't move! I'll shoot if you come after us!

00:10:52.150 --> 00:10:53.710
A carpet of clouds.

00:10:54.260 --> 00:10:55.880
It looks warm.

00:10:56.930 --> 00:10:59.550
They'll be shelling again
as a diversion.

00:11:01.300 --> 00:11:02.390
Where are we going?

00:11:02.460 --> 00:11:04.260
We'll fix your lost memories
with the help of A.E.U.G.!

00:11:04.800 --> 00:11:07.000
Memories? What memories?

00:11:07.070 --> 00:11:09.000
What do you mean?

00:11:09.070 --> 00:11:12.530
You were telling me in Hong Kong
how much you wanted your memory!

00:11:13.280 --> 00:11:14.970
You must get them restored!

00:11:15.040 --> 00:11:17.100
I must?

00:11:19.880 --> 00:11:21.110
Four, let's go!

00:11:27.060 --> 00:11:28.920
This is the end of the road, Kamille!

00:11:44.210 --> 00:11:46.110
Damn Karaba! They're still coming!

00:11:51.650 --> 00:11:53.200
He's falling.

00:11:53.280 --> 00:11:56.180
Would we have been killed
if you had not done it?

00:11:56.250 --> 00:11:58.950
Four. That's obvious!

00:12:21.210 --> 00:12:23.680
Spread out! Otherwise we'll get hit
from the surface!

00:12:30.390 --> 00:12:32.720
Where did Kamille sneak in?!

00:12:37.830 --> 00:12:41.420
Kamille! How dare you! How dare you!

00:12:54.210 --> 00:12:55.180
Four!

00:12:56.440 --> 00:12:58.410
Are you all right?

00:12:58.480 --> 00:13:00.380
I just felt a little dizzy.

00:13:00.450 --> 00:13:01.680
Do you need your medicine?

00:13:01.750 --> 00:13:03.780
I'm all right. I'm all right.

00:13:08.090 --> 00:13:09.060
Four!

00:13:09.160 --> 00:13:10.650
Four, can you run?

00:13:12.730 --> 00:13:13.060
Four.

00:13:17.470 --> 00:13:18.400
Four?

00:13:18.470 --> 00:13:19.760
What's happening?

00:13:19.840 --> 00:13:21.800
Who... are you?

00:13:23.040 --> 00:13:24.200
An enemy, aren't you?!

00:13:28.180 --> 00:13:29.580
Lieutenant! That's crazy!

00:13:30.050 --> 00:13:32.010
That one isn't ready for
actual battle yet!

00:13:32.280 --> 00:13:34.080
It's still being tested!

00:13:34.980 --> 00:13:37.010
It's a mobile suit, right?

00:13:37.690 --> 00:13:39.750
As long as it moves,
that's good enough for me!

00:13:43.860 --> 00:13:44.830
Lieutenant Jerid!

00:13:45.230 --> 00:13:46.390
Wait!

00:13:47.200 --> 00:13:48.750
Snap out of it, Four!

00:13:48.830 --> 00:13:51.390
It's me! Can't you tell it's me, Kamille?!

00:13:51.930 --> 00:13:53.130
- Sure I can tell!
- You can?

00:13:53.500 --> 00:13:56.700
You're Kamille Bidan,
pilot of the Zeta Gundam.

00:13:56.770 --> 00:14:00.170
You're known as a core combatant
of the A.E.U.G..

00:14:01.080 --> 00:14:02.040
Four.

00:14:03.450 --> 00:14:06.070
It's Kamille! I'm Kamille Bidan!

00:14:09.950 --> 00:14:10.920
Four!

00:14:12.290 --> 00:14:13.950
What is it, Four?

00:14:22.730 --> 00:14:24.060
Stop it, Four!

00:14:24.130 --> 00:14:25.690
You mustn't call that thing!

00:14:27.800 --> 00:14:28.770
F-Four!

00:14:36.580 --> 00:14:38.440
You mustn't! Don't get on that thing!

00:14:38.950 --> 00:14:40.710
That's the devil's machine!

00:14:40.780 --> 00:14:43.580
- Don't go!
- Will you stop it, already?!

00:14:43.650 --> 00:14:44.620
Four!

00:15:01.900 --> 00:15:03.270
Damn A.E.U.G..

00:15:03.340 --> 00:15:08.640
Your Excellency, our mobile suits will
make every effort to protect your shuttle.

00:15:09.180 --> 00:15:10.640
Please rest assured.

00:15:18.420 --> 00:15:20.390
You guys came to bully me.

00:15:21.120 --> 00:15:23.590
It was you who took
my memories from me!

00:15:26.330 --> 00:15:29.420
<i>You mustn't fight!</i>
<i>You really mustn't fight, Four!</i>

00:15:30.930 --> 00:15:31.900
Kamille?!

00:15:44.680 --> 00:15:46.510
Kamille! Get in the Zeta!

00:15:47.820 --> 00:15:49.680
Are you telling me to fire at Four?!

00:15:50.450 --> 00:15:52.320
This is a war, Kamille!

00:15:53.120 --> 00:15:55.110
But I am a human being!

00:15:55.190 --> 00:15:57.250
Don't talk like a child
at a time like this!

00:15:57.960 --> 00:16:01.020
You can find opportunities to
save people while fighting battles.

00:16:01.400 --> 00:16:03.190
You must look for those. Let's go!

00:16:04.400 --> 00:16:05.390
There is no such thing!

00:16:11.140 --> 00:16:14.370
What Lieutenant Quattro's talking about
only exists in an ideal world.

00:16:15.240 --> 00:16:16.800
I'm going to protect Four!

00:16:21.220 --> 00:16:23.480
Four, stop! Don't fight!

00:16:33.160 --> 00:16:35.150
Four! You mustn't fight!

00:16:35.230 --> 00:16:36.790
You're not well!

00:16:36.870 --> 00:16:39.230
There you are, Zeta Gundam!

00:16:50.450 --> 00:16:52.570
Kamille, stay back!

00:16:53.920 --> 00:16:56.680
Captain, please don't do it!
Don't attack her!

00:16:57.450 --> 00:17:00.050
- What do you want me to do?!
- <i>I'll persuade her!</i>

00:17:02.620 --> 00:17:03.390
Four!

00:17:03.460 --> 00:17:03.950
Stop!

00:17:04.360 --> 00:17:07.850
You've got a lot of confidence
to approach me like that!

00:17:11.900 --> 00:17:12.870
Four!

00:17:13.570 --> 00:17:14.540
What?!

00:17:17.470 --> 00:17:18.440
Kamille!

00:17:18.940 --> 00:17:20.100
Jerid?!

00:17:22.280 --> 00:17:24.340
<i>Psyco Gundam, this is an order!</i>

00:17:24.410 --> 00:17:25.280
What?!

00:17:25.350 --> 00:17:27.040
<i>Protect His Excellency Jamitov!</i>

00:17:27.120 --> 00:17:28.740
<i>Cover the shuttle's launch pad!</i>

00:17:31.650 --> 00:17:32.780
R-Roger.

00:17:38.230 --> 00:17:39.750
<i>Continuing countdown!</i>

00:17:39.830 --> 00:17:41.800
<i>Thirty seconds to take-off!</i>

00:17:45.430 --> 00:17:46.870
They're escaping to space?!

00:17:46.940 --> 00:17:47.800
Must be Jamitov!

00:17:50.910 --> 00:17:51.870
Don't come!

00:17:52.910 --> 00:17:53.810
<i>Okay.</i>

00:17:53.880 --> 00:17:56.610
<i>Don't move until</i>
<i>His Excellency Jamitov has escaped.</i>

00:17:56.680 --> 00:17:57.650
Roger!

00:17:58.180 --> 00:17:59.240
<i>What's this?</i>

00:17:59.310 --> 00:18:01.480
<i>Is this pressure coming from</i>
<i>that Cyber-Newtype, Four?</i>

00:18:01.950 --> 00:18:04.150
<i>Three... two... one...</i>

00:18:04.520 --> 00:18:05.580
<i>Liftoff!</i>

00:18:11.960 --> 00:18:13.150
You're not getting away, Jamitov!

00:18:24.270 --> 00:18:27.260
- How could I let him get away?
- <i>We'll have other chances.</i>

00:18:35.180 --> 00:18:37.240
Our assault force has succeeded!

00:18:37.320 --> 00:18:38.790
Look, Amuro!

00:18:46.260 --> 00:18:47.230
Four!

00:18:49.700 --> 00:18:51.600
Are you running away, Kamille?!

00:18:56.440 --> 00:18:58.960
Four, are you okay?! Four!

00:19:00.140 --> 00:19:01.870
<i>Answer me, Four!</i>

00:19:03.980 --> 00:19:05.540
<i>Four! Four!</i>

00:19:05.910 --> 00:19:07.710
Kamille, where are you?!

00:19:08.120 --> 00:19:09.880
<i>I'm here, Four.</i>

00:19:11.120 --> 00:19:12.810
Kamille?! Kamille?!

00:19:13.250 --> 00:19:14.220
Kamille!

00:19:15.320 --> 00:19:16.220
Okay!

00:19:16.290 --> 00:19:17.550
Open the cockpit!

00:19:18.330 --> 00:19:20.690
Kamille, is it you?

00:19:20.760 --> 00:19:22.730
<i>You must get out of</i>
<i>the Psyco Gundam's cockpit!</i>

00:19:23.200 --> 00:19:24.170
<i>Hurry!</i>

00:19:27.270 --> 00:19:28.740
Die, Kamille!

00:19:29.770 --> 00:19:30.530
Jerid!

00:19:30.610 --> 00:19:31.540
Stay back!

00:19:37.450 --> 00:19:38.500
Four!!

00:19:58.630 --> 00:19:59.930
Four!!

00:20:01.070 --> 00:20:02.300
<i>Kamille.</i>

00:20:02.370 --> 00:20:06.700
<i>Don't feel sad.</i>
<i>This way, I can see you anytime.</i>

00:20:06.770 --> 00:20:10.640
<i>Because now, I can truly live</i>
<i>inside of you.</i>

00:20:20.520 --> 00:20:22.320
Four!

00:20:22.390 --> 00:20:23.690
Wake up, Four!

00:20:28.900 --> 00:20:31.090
Four, open your eyes!

00:20:31.170 --> 00:20:32.390
You're kidding me, right?!

00:20:32.470 --> 00:20:34.160
This is all a lie, right?!

00:20:34.240 --> 00:20:36.640
Open your eyes, Four!!

00:20:42.940 --> 00:20:46.240
People end up repeating
the same mistakes.

00:20:47.220 --> 00:20:48.310
It's ridiculous!

00:20:49.180 --> 00:20:50.620
The same mistake...!

00:20:50.690 --> 00:20:51.980
<i>Lieutenant Quattro.</i>

00:20:52.690 --> 00:20:54.550
<i>Secondary explosions are</i>
<i>shaking the fortress.</i>

00:20:54.620 --> 00:20:56.590
<i>Momentarily, the whole summit</i>
<i>will blow up.</i>

00:20:56.660 --> 00:20:57.960
All right.

00:20:58.030 --> 00:21:00.290
<i>All mobile suits, make your way</i>
<i>to the Audhumla!</i>

00:21:00.360 --> 00:21:01.660
<i>We'll be on our way shortly!</i>

00:21:02.230 --> 00:21:03.200
Kamille!

00:21:03.300 --> 00:21:04.530
It's too dangerous here!

00:21:04.600 --> 00:21:06.000
We're retreating!

00:21:08.940 --> 00:21:11.200
Kamille! What are you doing?!

00:21:11.270 --> 00:21:13.000
You'll be swallowed by the explosion!

00:21:13.570 --> 00:21:14.510
Kamille!

00:21:14.580 --> 00:21:17.340
I feel for you,
but you can't die here!

00:21:18.810 --> 00:21:20.250
<i>Kamille, get on!</i>

00:21:23.750 --> 00:21:27.590
Warriors are destined to fight
as long as they live.

00:21:31.330 --> 00:21:32.880
Captain Amuro, let's go!

00:21:32.960 --> 00:21:33.930
Okay.

00:21:34.500 --> 00:21:36.360
There's a big one on its way.

00:22:06.160 --> 00:22:09.560
I'll never be calling you
"Lieutenant Quattro" again.

00:22:10.000 --> 00:22:13.020
You have no choice
but to return to "Char Aznable."

00:22:15.340 --> 00:22:16.960
You're right, Kamille.

00:22:47.270 --> 00:22:49.600
Oh, I can't help believing you

00:22:50.480 --> 00:22:56.020
kanarazu aeru to ano hi kara shinjiteita

00:22:50.480 --> 00:22:56.020
I've believed we're sure to meet again ever since that day

00:22:56.070 --> 00:23:01.400
kitto yobiau kokoro ga areba

00:22:56.070 --> 00:23:01.400
If we have heart, we'll be called together again

00:23:01.450 --> 00:23:11.790
mugen no Energy yobisamasu

00:23:01.450 --> 00:23:11.790
Awaken the infinite energy

00:23:11.830 --> 00:23:17.420
aa kizutsukeau mae ni

00:23:11.830 --> 00:23:17.420
Before you get hurt

00:23:17.460 --> 00:23:23.510
dekiru koto sagashite Please

00:23:17.460 --> 00:23:23.510
Find what you can do...Please

00:23:23.550 --> 00:23:28.680
nagedasanai de kurushii toki koso

00:23:23.550 --> 00:23:28.680
Don't throw it away because of this painful age

00:23:29.390 --> 00:23:32.020
itsuka mita aoi sora wo

00:23:29.390 --> 00:23:32.020
Until the day we gaze up again

00:23:32.030 --> 00:23:39.030
kitto anata to miageru hi made

00:23:32.030 --> 00:23:39.030
at the blue sky we once saw

00:23:46.360 --> 00:23:47.090
Karaba takes over...

00:23:47.160 --> 00:23:50.320
...the general assembly of
the Earth Federation Government.

00:23:50.800 --> 00:23:54.060
There, Char discloses his identity...

00:23:54.270 --> 00:23:56.260
...and tells the world about the dangers
of the Titans.

00:23:57.740 --> 00:24:00.570
It is a signal to indicate the beginning
of a new era.

00:24:01.610 --> 00:24:06.240
Next on Mobile Suit Zeta Gundam,
"The Day of Dakar".

00:24:06.950 --> 00:24:09.480
You will see the tears of time.

00:24:07.460 --> 00:24:12.440
Next Episode

00:24:07.460 --> 00:24:12.440
The Day of Dakar
